  <text>
    <body>
      <div type="clause" n="55">
        <head><ref type="lawCode" target="law:Northu">Northu</ref> 55</head>
        <ab type="selectedText" xml:lang="und">Sunnandæges cypingc we forbeodað æghwar 7 ælc folcgemot 7 ælc weorc 7 ælce lade ægðer ge on wæne ge on horse ge on byrdene.</ab>
        <ab type="translation" xml:lang="en">Sunday market we forbid everywhere, and every public assembly and all work and all carrying [of goods], whether by wagon or by horse or on one's back.</ab>
        <ab type="secondTranslation" xml:lang="en">We everywhere forbid trade on a Sunday and every public meeting and every type of labour and every type of transport, either by wagon or by horse or by carried load.</ab>
      </div>
